#: templates/booket/about.html:1154
msgid ""
"Clients can book at 2 AM from any device. No phone call, no waiting. Your "
"business keeps accepting appointments while you sleep."
msgstr "Клиенты могут записаться в 2 ночи с любого устройства. Никаких звонков, никакого ожидания. Ваш бизнес принимает записи пока вы спите."

#: templates/booket/about.html:1158
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "SMS OTP confirmations"
msgid "SMS OTP verification"
msgstr "SMS OTP-подтверждения"

#: templates/booket/about.html:1159
msgid ""
"Every booking is confirmed by a one-time SMS code sent to the client's "
"phone. This eliminates fake appointments and ensures real phone numbers."
